# Agent brain

This repo uses the portable `.agent/` brain. Read in order:

1. `.agent/AGENTS.md` — the map.
2. `.agent/memory/personal/PREFERENCES.md` — user's stable conventions.
3. `.agent/memory/semantic/LESSONS.md` — distilled patterns.
4. `.agent/skills/_index.md` — discover skills. Load the full `SKILL.md`
   only when its triggers match the current task.
5. `.agent/protocols/permissions.md` — check before any tool call.

## Task framing

See `program.md` for the directive. When running experiments:

- Every iteration MUST run in a fresh-context subagent. See
  `.agent/skills/subagent-dispatcher/SKILL.md`. In Cursor, prefer
  a new tab/agent session per iteration rather than continuing in the
  same context.
- Never modify `prepare.py`. Never add dependencies. Never commit
  `results.tsv`.
- Never stop the loop until explicitly interrupted.
